            "sid": "MAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi asema: “Tazama, siku yaja, nayo inawaka kama tanuri. Wenye kiburi na waovu wote watatupwa humo na kuteketea kama mabua makavu; watateketea kabisa pasibaki hata alama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kwa ajili yenu nyinyi mnaonicha, uwezo wangu wa kuokoa utawachomozea kama jua lililo na nguvu za kuponya kwenye mionzi yake. Mtatoka mkirukaruka kama ndama watokapo zizini mwao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo mtawakanyagakanyaga waovu, nao watakuwa kama majivu chini ya nyayo zenu. Nasema mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
